## BreachPilot-style security workflow

For authorized security assessment, penetration-testing, vulnerability-validation, exploitability-research, attack-path, CTF/lab, source/artifact review, or recon-to-report tasks, load and follow `breachpilot-mindset/SKILL.md` before acting. Run the workflow directly using your own reasoning and native runtime capabilities; no BreachPilot backend, MCP server, or separate planner is required. Stay within the stated scope, and report when a capability needed for a live check is unavailable.
